    {
      "id": "claim_001ccd1531cd430381c26a5e50a9e5fd",
      "statement": "PublishAot plus EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator make reflection-based configuration binding a build-breaking pattern: binding must use the source-generated binder, and config properties keep `= null!;` initializers instead of `required` because the generated binder needs settable non-required members (CS9035).",
